# Analysis script, not a test. It describes a page and writes Configuration/pages/ContactForm.json.
#
# These run before the test cases and only when analysis is asked for (--analyse, or RunAnalysis in
# run.config.json). Once a page is described the configuration is committed and reused, so a normal
# run -- and a pipeline -- skips this entirely.

use Supervisor
analyse "/0/Shell/#Card/Contacts_FormPage/edit/c4ed336c-3e9b-40fe-8b82-5632476472b4" ContactForm
